    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the eerie realm of the Backrooms, brought to life with stunning realism through the power of Unreal Engine 5. Navigate through intricately designed levels filled with puzzles to solve, all while evading relentless entities that lurk in the shadows. Dare to explore, strategize, and survive as you journey deeper into the haunting unknown.<br><br><u><strong>Unique Level and Monster Design</strong></u><br>There is a reason why this is titled a slightly different Backrooms:<br>Each corridor holds a new surprise, each monster a unique terror to overcome that you <strong>haven't</strong> seen in any other Backrooms. The Level Design is 100% Custom, besided some classics like level 0. Prepare for an adventure where the only constant is the spine-chilling thrill of the unknown.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/c5506c63147ae382f79875cf5cbce021.poster.avif?t=1711891894\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/c5506c63147ae382f79875cf5cbce021.webm?t=1711891894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/c5506c63147ae382f79875cf5cbce021.mp4?t=1711891894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Co-op Multiplayer</u></strong><br>Embark on a heart-pounding journey with up to <strong>4 players</strong> in the Backrooms. Work together to <strong>solve Puzzles</strong>, Scream together if you're allowed to and use Features like Rock-Paper-Scissors to deside who should enter the haunting corridor first!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/ab9c9fec6598a0e025445d3e0e72ccb9.poster.avif?t=1711891894\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/ab9c9fec6598a0e025445d3e0e72ccb9.webm?t=1711891894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896330/extras/ab9c9fec6598a0e025445d3e0e72ccb9.mp4?t=1711891894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Proximity Voice Chat</u></strong><br>Engage in strategic communication with your teammates using proximity voice chat, but tread carefully; lurking entities may eavesdrop and track your whereabouts.",
